Subject: [PATCH 4/7] riscv: mark ordinary RVV spills with StackObject
 PCSections

Chimera LLVM patch 4 of 7. Chimera behavior is enabled per function by the
"chimera-stack-object" string attribute; stock RISC-V codegen is unchanged.
